$code — local coding LLM (Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct / llama-cpp)

SUMMARY
  Runs Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct on a JSON request built from prompts[],
  texts[] (code context), and files[]. Writes completions into texts[].

SYNTAX
  $code
  $code[3]
  $code(model='default', max_tokens=2048, temperature=0.2, system='You are…')

INPUT
  prompts[] — task instructions (JSON "prompts" array).
  texts[]   — extra context joined into JSON "code_context".
  files[]   — source files as JSON "files" entries ({path, name, content}).

OUTPUT
  texts[] — one .txt link per completion variant (input texts[] are consumed,
            not passed through).
  request.json — the JSON request written under the op dir (inspectable).

REQUEST JSON
  {
    "prompts": ["…"],
    "code_context": "joined texts…",
    "files": [{"path": "…", "name": "…", "content": "…"}]
  }

ARGUMENTS
  model=        — GGUF profile (externals/code/model_paths.py CODE_MODELS). Default: default
  max_tokens=   — generation limit (default 2048)
  temperature=  — sampling temperature (default 0.2)
  seed=         — RNG seed; offset per variant when repeat > 1
  system=       — system prompt string
  gpu_layers= / n_gpu_layers= — layers on GPU (llama-cpp)
  n_ctx=        — fixed context size (default: auto-sized from request)
  count=        — variants if [n] suffix not used

CONTEXT
  n_ctx is chosen automatically from the trimmed JSON request (smallest power-of-two
  that fits). Default auto cap: AH_CODE_AUTO_MAX_N_CTX=16384 (faster than 32k).
  Set AH_CODE_AUTO_MAX_N_CTX=32768 for larger prompts; AH_CODE_EXTENDED_CTX=1 for
  YaRN above 32k (slower; llama.cpp may warn n_ctx_seq > n_ctx_train).

  $code runs in-process by default (model cached). Subprocess: AH_EXTERNAL_SUBPROCESS=code.

  Caps: AH_CODE_MAX_N_CTX (131072), AH_CODE_MIN_N_CTX (4096).

  Large folders: request is trimmed if it still exceeds the chosen window.
  stderr logs the chosen n_ctx and any truncated/omitted files.

REPEAT SYNTAX
  $code[n] — n separate completions.

MODEL
  model=default / 14b — models/code/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Instruct/model.gguf
  model=1.5b — models/code/Qwen2.5-Coder-1.5B-Instruct/model.gguf (~1 GB Q4_K_M)
  Download:
    uv run python tools/download_code_model.py --model 1.5b
    uv run python tools/download_models.py --upstream-fallback
  HF instruct (QLoRA): uv run python tools/download_code_model.py --model 1.5b --hf-instruct
    → models/code/Qwen2.5-Coder-1.5B-Instruct-HF/ from Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-1.5B-Instruct

ENVIRONMENT
  AH_EMULATE_CODE=1 — placeholder text files, no model load.
  LLM_N_GPU_LAYERS — default GPU layer count when arg omitted.
  Requires: uv pip install llama-cpp-python (CUDA wheel for GPU).

EXAMPLE
  @refactor: @sources -> $code -> $save('out.py')
  Refactor the module for clarity.

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  Yes.
